"about_items": [
{
"n": "#486·12",
"text": "This is a structured graphite blazer with a clean straight cut. It features classic lapels, two front buttons, and welt pockets, worn here over a crisp white shirt for a sharp yet understated look suitable for formal events."
},
{
"n": "#225·27",
"text": "These are high-waisted wool trousers in a grey plaid pattern. They offer a tailored fit with a visible back seam, falling to the ankle in a straight line that balances the broader silhouette of your figure."
},
{
"n": "#159·10",
"text": "A soft black turtleneck sweater from CHARLIE sits beneath the blazer. Its high neckline adds modesty and warmth, while the fitted cut elongates your torso without adding bulk to the upper zone."
},
{
"n": "#349·33",
"text": "Round stud earrings in polished gold with a black center and subtle logo detail. They offer a refined touch of sparkle that respects the solemnity of the day, avoiding overwhelming brightness."
},
{
"n": "#66·11",
"text": "Elegant black leather pumps with a modest heel and a sleek pointed toe. Their quiet profile provides comfort for long hours while maintaining a polished appearance under the blazer."
},
{
"n": "#232·33",
"text": "A structured crossbody bag in graphite canvas with leather accents and a signature green-and-red stripe. Its neutral tone anchors the look, keeping visual weight low so attention remains on your presence rather than your belongings."
}
]
}
